## 2. Data Models, Fields, Types, Relations & Indexes

### 2.1 User
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `name`: String (Required, trimmed, 2-50 chars)
  - `email`: String (Required, unique, lowercase, indexed)
  - `passwordHash`: String (Required, select: false)
  - `role`: String (Enum: `['customer', 'restaurant_owner', 'admin']`, Default: `'customer'`, indexed)
  - `isStudent`: Boolean (Default: false)
  - `studentVerified`: Boolean (Default: false, indexed)
  - `studentIdEmail`: String (Optional, verified domain `.edu` / `.ac.in`)
  - `addresses`: Array of:
    - `label`: String (`'Home'`, `'Hostel / PG'`, `'Campus'`, `'Office'`)
    - `street`: String
    - `city`: String (Indexed)
    - `state`: String
    - `pincode`: String
    - `isDefault`: Boolean
  - `walletBalance`: Number (Default: 0.0, min: 0)
  - `loyaltyPoints`: Number (Default: 0, min: 0)
  - `failedLoginAttempts`: Number (Default: 0)
  - `lockUntil`: Date (Optional)
  - `refreshToken`: String (Select: false)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ email: 1 }` (unique)
  - `{ role: 1 }`
  - `{ studentVerified: 1 }`

### 2.2 Restaurant
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `name`: String (Required, trimmed, indexed)
  - `owner`: ObjectId (Ref: `'User'`, Required, indexed)
  - `cuisines`: [String] (Indexed, e.g. `['North Indian', 'Biryani', 'South Indian', 'Chaat', 'Mughlai']`)
  - `city`: String (Indexed, Top 10 Indian Metros: `Mumbai`, `Delhi NCR`, `Bengaluru`, `Hyderabad`, `Chennai`, `Kolkata`, `Pune`, `Ahmedabad`, `Jaipur`, `Chandigarh`)
  - `address`: String (Required)
  - `rating`: Number (Default: 4.0, min: 1.0, max: 5.0, indexed)
  - `totalRatings`: Number (Default: 0)
  - `avgDeliveryTime`: Number (In minutes, e.g. 25, 30, 45, indexed)
  - `isVegOnly`: Boolean (Default: false, indexed)
  - `isOpen`: Boolean (Default: true, indexed)
  - `image`: String (URL)
  - `priceForTwo`: Number (Required, e.g. 300, 500, indexed)
  - `isStudentFavorite`: Boolean (Default: false, indexed)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ city: 1, isOpen: 1, rating: -1 }` (Compound index for primary city feed)
  - `{ cuisines: 1 }`
  - `{ priceForTwo: 1 }`
  - `{ avgDeliveryTime: 1 }`
  - `{ isVegOnly: 1 }`
  - `{ name: "text", cuisines: "text", address: "text" }` (Full-text search)

### 2.3 MenuItem
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `restaurant`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Restaurant'`, Required, indexed)
  - `name`: String (Required, trimmed, indexed)
  - `description`: String
  - `price`: Number (Required, min: 0, indexed)
  - `category`: String (Required, e.g. `'Thalis & Combos'`, `'Starters'`, `'Biryanis'`, `'Breads & Curries'`, `'Desserts & Beverages'`)
  - `isVeg`: Boolean (Default: true, indexed)
  - `isVegan`: Boolean (Default: false)
  - `isJain`: Boolean (Default: false)
  - `isAvailable`: Boolean (Default: true, indexed)
  - `image`: String (URL)
  - `calories`: Number (e.g. 450 kcal)
  - `protein`: Number (In grams, e.g. 22g for high-protein filter)
  - `isStudentSpecial`: Boolean (Default: false, combo/meal under ₹150, indexed)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ restaurant: 1, category: 1 }`
  - `{ restaurant: 1, isAvailable: 1 }`
  - `{ price: 1 }`
  - `{ isStudentSpecial: 1 }`

### 2.4 Cart
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `user`: ObjectId (Ref: `'User'`, Required, unique, indexed)
  - `restaurant`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Restaurant'`, Required)
  - `items`: Array of:
    - `menuItem`: ObjectId (Ref: `'MenuItem'`, Required)
    - `name`: String
    - `price`: Number (Server validated)
    - `qty`: Number (Min: 1, Max: 50)
    - `isVeg`: Boolean
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ user: 1 }` (Unique)

### 2.5 Order
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `orderNumber`: String (Unique, e.g. `'FH-DEL-2026-9812'`)
  - `user`: ObjectId (Ref: `'User'`, Required, indexed)
  - `restaurant`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Restaurant'`, Required, indexed)
  - `items`: Array of:
    - `menuItem`: ObjectId (Ref: `'MenuItem'`)
    - `name`: String
    - `price`: Number
    - `qty`: Number
    - `itemTotal`: Number
  - `subtotal`: Number (Required)
  - `discountsApplied`: Array of:
    - `type`: String (`'STUDENT_DISCOUNT'`, `'COUPON'`, `'STUDENT_FREE_DELIVERY'`, `'LOYALTY_REDEEM'`)
    - `code`: String
    - `amount`: Number
  - `discountTotal`: Number (Default: 0)
  - `deliveryFee`: Number (Default: 40)
  - `tax`: Number (5% GST for Indian restaurants)
  - `total`: Number (Required)
  - `status`: String (Enum: `['PLACED', 'ACCEPTED', 'PREPARING', 'OUT_FOR_DELIVERY', 'DELIVERED', 'CANCELLED']`, Default: `'PLACED'`, indexed)
  - `paymentMethod`: String (Enum: `['COD', 'UPI', 'CARD', 'WALLET']`, Required)
  - `paymentStatus`: String (Enum: `['PENDING', 'COMPLETED', 'FAILED', 'REFUNDED']`, Default: `'COMPLETED'`)
  - `idempotencyKey`: String (Indexed)
  - `deliveryAddress`: Object (Address snapshot)
  - `scheduledFor`: Date (Optional for Scheduled Orders)
  - `timeline`: Array of `{ status: String, timestamp: Date, message: String }`
  - `cancelReason`: String
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ user: 1, createdAt: -1 }`
  - `{ restaurant: 1, status: 1 }`
  - `{ status: 1 }`
  - `{ idempotencyKey: 1 }`

### 2.6 Coupon
- **Fields**:
  - `code`: String (Unique, uppercase, trimmed, indexed)
  - `description`: String
  - `type`: String (Enum: `['PERCENTAGE', 'FLAT']`, Required)
  - `value`: Number (e.g. 20 for 20% or 50 for ₹50 flat)
  - `minOrder`: Number (Default: 0)
  - `maxDiscount`: Number (For percentage coupons, e.g. ₹100 cap)
  - `validFrom`: Date (Required)
  - `validTo`: Date (Required, indexed)
  - `usageLimit`: Number (Max global uses)
  - `usedCount`: Number (Default: 0)
  - `isStackableWithStudent`: Boolean (Default: false)
  - `applicableTo`: String (Enum: `['ALL', 'STUDENTS_ONLY', 'FIRST_ORDER']`, Default: `'ALL'`)
  - `isActive`: Boolean (Default: true, indexed)
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ code: 1 }` (Unique)
  - `{ isActive: 1, validTo: 1 }`

### 2.7 Review
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `user`: ObjectId (Ref: `'User'`, Required, indexed)
  - `restaurant`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Restaurant'`, Required, indexed)
  - `order`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Order'`, Required, unique, indexed — 1 review per delivered order)
  - `rating`: Number (Required, 1-5 stars)
  - `comment`: String (Trimmed, 5-500 chars)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps
- **Indexes**:
  - `{ restaurant: 1, createdAt: -1 }`
  - `{ order: 1 }` (Unique)

### 2.8 GroupOrder (Split Bill Feature)
- **Fields**:
  - `_id`: ObjectId
  - `code`: String (Unique, 6-character alphanumeric share code, indexed)
  - `creator`: ObjectId (Ref: `'User'`, Required)
  - `restaurant`: ObjectId (Ref: `'Restaurant'`, Required)
  - `members`: Array of:
    - `name`: String
    - `userId`: ObjectId (Optional, if logged in)
    - `items`: Array of `{ menuItem: ObjectId, name: String, price: Number, qty: Number }`
    - `shareAmount`: Number
    - `paid`: Boolean
  - `status`: String (Enum: `['OPEN', 'LOCKED', 'ORDERED', 'CANCELLED']`, Default: `'OPEN'`)
  - `createdAt`, `updatedAt`: Timestamps

