## 4. Order Status Flow & State Machine

```
[PLACED]
   │
   ├── (Cancelled within 2 mins) ───────────────► [CANCELLED] (Refund to Wallet)
   │
   ▼
[ACCEPTED] (Restaurant confirms kitchen capacity)
   │
   ▼
[PREPARING] (Kitchen cooks fresh meal)
   │
   ▼
[OUT_FOR_DELIVERY] (Delivery partner dispatched, live GPS ETA active)
   │
   ▼
[DELIVERED] (OTP confirmed at doorstep; Loyalty points credited; Review unlocked)
```

**State Transitions Rules**:
- Valid transitions: `PLACED` → `ACCEPTED` → `PREPARING` → `OUT_FOR_DELIVERY` → `DELIVERED`.
- `CANCELLED` is only permitted from `PLACED` (or by Admin in exception cases).
- Reviews can strictly only be posted when order status === `DELIVERED`.
- Loyalty points (1 point per ₹10 paid) are awarded upon `DELIVERED`.
